  "description": "[EXPERIMENTAL] WPF map control (MlnMapImage) backed by MapLibre Native (mln-cabi). Renders the map as an ordinary in-tree WPF Image — no HwndHost, no airspace — for WPF applications without requiring a MAUI dependency. MapLibreNative.Maui is pulled in automatically as a dependency. Built against a fork of maplibre-native; not the stable MapLibreNative.Maui line.",
